WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.827
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with international

00:00:04.827 --> 00:00:06.963
artists and communities around the world.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:10.535
Choose finished works and give each a title label.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:14.621
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:21.039
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question. Justify a

00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:23.869
revision using evidence from another world tradition.
